  <para unique="1091625">
   <string>EVEX.512 encoded version: The first source operand is a ZMM register. The second source operand is a ZMM register, a 512-bit memory location, or a 512-bit vector broadcasted from a 32-bit memory location. The destina&#173;tion operand is a ZMM register, conditionally updated using writemask k1. </string></para>
  <para unique="1091626">
   <string>EVEX.256 encoded version: The first source operand is a YMM register. The second source operand is a YMM register, a 256-bit memory location, or a 256-bit vector broadcasted from a 32-bit memory location. The destina&#173;tion operand is a YMM register, conditionally updated using writemask k1. </string></para>
  <para unique="1091627">
   <string>EVEX.128 encoded version: The first source operand is a XMM register. The second source operand is a XMM register, a 128-bit memory location, or a 128-bit vector broadcasted from a 32-bit memory location. The destina&#173;tion operand is a XMM register, conditionally updated using writemask k1. </string></para>
  </longdesc>
